{"lang":"pa","lot":2,"out":[{"pack":"humor","key":"break_ice","register":"neutral","fr":"Pour briser la glace, je vous offre un café ?","text":"ਗੱਲਬਾਤ ਸ਼ੁਰੂ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ, ਕੀ ਮੈਂ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਇੱਕ ਕੌਫ਼ੀ ਪਿਲਾਵਾਂ?","back":"Pour entamer la conversation, puis-je vous offrir un café ?","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"just_kidding","register":"informal","fr":"Je plaisante, bien sûr !","text":"ਬੇਸ਼ੱਕ, ਇਹ ਤਾਂ ਮਜ਼ਾਕ ਸੀ!","back":"Bien sûr, c’était une blague !","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"monday_irony","register":"ironic","fr":"Génial, on est lundi…","text":"ਵਾਹ, ਅੱਜ ਸੋਮਵਾਰ ਹੈ…","back":"Waouh, aujourd’hui c’est lundi…","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"monday_irony","register":"neutral_meaning","fr":"Je n'aime pas les lundis.","text":"ਮੈਨੂੰ ਸੋਮਵਾਰ ਪਸੰਦ ਨਹੀਂ।","back":"Je n’aime pas le lundi.","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"}]}